Description: macOS Spotlight-inspired launcher for GNOME 50 on Wayland
 A high-performance, keyboard-first desktop launcher and command palette
 for GNOME 50 on Linux, built with Qt 6, Qt Quick / QML, C++, and embedded
 Lua 5.4. Features integrated AI Assistant, application search, GNOME settings,
 calculator, files search, and an extensible Lua plugin runtime.
